  "comment": "Per-block list style (owner 2026-10-16): object.create/update carry the optional nullable listStyle node field (\"numbered\" | \"alpha\" | \"roman\"; absent/null = the bullet default, present-null clears — the icon/color precedent). The stored column carries ONLY the style; the marker NUMBER is derived at render time from the contiguous run of same-style siblings, never stored. Envelopes 1-2 create a plain page and a numbered block under it; envelope 3 re-styles the block (set); envelope 4 clears back to bullet; envelope 5 styles the page itself (the field is per-node, applier-unrestricted). Additive payload on strict schemas — pre-batch clients reject the new key, so LOCKSTEP-PENDING: the GTK/Flutter ports accept it before the marker clears (docs/developers/development.md §3).",
